msgstr "Kreye yon travay rafrechisman pou sejou chak jou pou chanm okipe yo."

msgctxt "help:hotel.hotel,inspection_required:"
msgid ""
"If checked, a cleaned room becomes available only once a supervisor has "
"inspected it."
msgstr ""
"Si li make, yon chanm netwaye vin disponib sèlman lè yon sipèvizè enspekte "
"li."

